Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.72,0:00:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things were busy that summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.42,0:00:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The frequent disasters of the\Npast year probably played a role,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.04,0:00:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but cursed spirits were\Nspringing up like maggots.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.32,0:00:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exercise, absorb, over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.24,0:00:56.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exercise, absorb.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.14,0:00:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one else understands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What cursed spirits taste like.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.32,0:01:07.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They taste like swallowing down a dirty\Nrag used to clean up shit and vomit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.62,0:01:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.32,0:01:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absorb.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I witnessed isn't uncommon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.18,0:01:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understood the ugliness of the masses.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.38,0:01:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And still, I chose to be a\NJujutsu sorcerer who saves others.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.14,0:01:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I've been telling\Nmyself ever since that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.50,0:01:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ever since that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.28,0:01:36.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.19,0:01:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this used to be the home of\Nthe president of a company
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.68,0:01:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who managed a local chain\Nof barbecue restaurants.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.08,0:01:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, in July of last year, remember\Nthat whole mad cow disease problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.64,0:01:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it dealt a fatal blow to his\Nrestaurants and buried him in debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.04,0:01:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wound up committing\Nsuicide with his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.68,0:02:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since then, local rumors claim\Nthe president's home was haunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.46,0:02:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,High school students, college students,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.78,0:02:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lots of people started visiting\Nthe place as a test of courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.38,0:02:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then they started going missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.54,0:02:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those rumors only brought about
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.00,0:02:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,more rumors, and the damage\Njust continued to spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.10,0:02:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haunted locations have always attracted
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.42,0:02:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a high quotient of speculation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.18,0:02:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And nowadays, thanks to the internet,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.60,0:02:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rumors can spread at an\Nunbelievable speed. That means.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.16,0:02:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's all just even more work\Nfor us Jujutsu sorcerers to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.02,0:02:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,investigate and eliminate in\Naddition to the older victims
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.60,0:02:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there were three young kids who\Nwent missing on their way home
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.06,0:02:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from school there's also a high\Nprobability that the families
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.36,0:02:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,police staff co-workers and\Nfriends who trace the paths
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.80,0:02:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of those who disappear will\Nfind that they become victims
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.62,0:02:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,themselves we have to sever the\Nroot of this problem quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.26,0:02:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hq sent us to investigate because\Nthey reached the same conclusion
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.48,0:02:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're even paying my fees
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.64,0:03:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which aren't cheap Mei Mei,\Ndid you overcharge them again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.80,0:03:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You make it sound so bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.28,0:03:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call it negotiation!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.68,0:03:07.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.34,0:03:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go then.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.93,0:03:16.23,Show_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\3c&H86C8C7&}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.38,0:03:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emerge from darkness, black or still.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.48,0:03:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Purified that there's\Nno need for a veil huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.62,0:03:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't sense the presence\Nof any curses around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.94,0:03:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cause is almost certainly\Ninside of the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.40,0:03:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can cast the veil later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.44,0:03:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we end up attacking it\Nfrom outside, it's open.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.79,0:03:37.00,Main,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(175,0)\fnComic Sans MS\fs12\fsp2\c&H302510&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\bord1\3a&H60&\pos(242.667,200)}...True.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.64,0:03:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like something's\Nblocking the door, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.62,0:03:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.30,0:03:52.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mei Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.52,0:03:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.66,0:03:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's all around us, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.14,0:04:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.72,0:04:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need that, but you do. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.64,0:04:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, I really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.58,0:04:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.98,0:04:27.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.72,0:04:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it still has electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.88,0:04:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now, let's just have a look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.24,0:04:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take this floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.64,0:04:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You take the second.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.00,0:04:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.91,0:04:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All by myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.18,0:04:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there a problem with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.26,0:04:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.76,0:04:49.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.67,0:04:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.98,0:04:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.32,0:05:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.64,0:05:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.34,0:06:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got some impressive pumps there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.56,0:06:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, please don't startle me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.10,0:06:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were already startled\Nbefore I got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.66,0:06:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you done exploring the first floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.80,0:06:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.50,0:06:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the first floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.48,0:06:50.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.76,0:06:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was walking down the first\Nfloor's hallway when I found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.74,0:06:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.78,0:06:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I entered a room\Nat the end of the hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.42,0:07:02.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.38,0:07:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A box of candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.88,0:07:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bag of potato chips,\Na can, a backpack, a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.16,0:07:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sweatshirt i've already seen these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.04,0:07:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three times see these\Nmarks along the wall i
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.10,0:07:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,left them to mark my way\Nso i wouldn't get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.48,0:07:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well well it would seem that we're\Nalready in the belly of the beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.64,0:07:29.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.78,0:07:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.52,0:07:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long can this hallway possibly be?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.18,0:07:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just goes on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.80,0:07:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been walking for 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.08,0:07:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's about four kilometers so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.30,0:07:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not an innate domain, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.48,0:07:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.50,0:08:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a manifestation of the\Nspirit's mindscape, which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.30,0:08:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.98,0:08:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.89,0:08:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most likely the victims\Nwere trapped inside this,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.66,0:08:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then killed by the cursed spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.34,0:08:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though considering the\Nuse of this technique,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.38,0:08:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the cursed spirit itself should be weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.62,0:08:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we need to do is escape this barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.86,0:08:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, quiz time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.88,0:08:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Utahime, how would\Nyou break this barrier?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.74,0:08:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This hallway is repeating itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.86,0:08:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At first, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.84,0:08:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At first, I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.06,0:08:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you could touch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.34,0:08:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At first, I thought it\Nwas shaped like a donut.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.30,0:08:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we passed four of the\Nmarks you made right I
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.54,0:08:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,calculated how many paces\Nwere between them and got
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.24,0:08:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,122 203 157
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.26,0:09:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and 270 so the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.62,0:09:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,spacing between your marks
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.86,0:09:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were completely random go\Non the interval between
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.16,0:09:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,individual repetitions\Nisn't standardized which
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.18,0:09:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,means that there's a very\Ngood possibility this
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.26,0:09:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,barrier is patching spaces\Ntogether. So if we both
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.66,0:09:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,run down the hallway at top\Nspeed then at some point
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.18,0:09:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll break hmm very close 90 points
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.26,0:09:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where did i lose 10 points when we run
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.02,0:09:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we run in opposite directions\Nin sync now I see so my patching
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.82,0:09:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,theory was accurate then And if we\Nquickly run in opposite directions,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.38,0:09:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that makes it harder for the cursed\Nspirit to hold the barrier together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.06,0:09:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And once we have that opening,\Nwe might be able to get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.36,0:09:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One hundred points.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.44,0:09:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.12,0:10:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this works, then, I'm\Ncounting on you for my promotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.10,0:10:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much do you have in savings? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.14,0:10:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.38,0:10:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.54,0:10:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.80,0:10:13.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.02,0:10:15.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.02,0:10:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.86,0:10:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here to save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.98,0:10:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Utahime?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.56,0:11:03.32,Show_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1000)\pos(320,10)}JUJUTSU KAISEN\N{\fs16\bord0\fscy100}Hidden Inventory/Premature Death
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.76,0:12:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.96,0:12:21.30,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(530,173)\p1\bord0\shad0\an5\c&HF9F9F9&}m 0 0 l 140 0 l 140 200 l 0 200
Dialogue: 2,0:12:18.96,0:12:21.30,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(530,173)\an5\fnTimes New Roman\fs14\fscy140\c&H000000&\bord0\shad0\b1}Jujutsu High\NSecond-Year\N{\fs30}Satoru\NGojo
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.10,0:12:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You crying? No! I'm not crying!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.30,0:12:26.51,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(75,95)\p1\bord0\shad0\an5\c&HF9F9F9&}m 0 0 l 100 0 l 100 140 l 0 140
Dialogue: 2,0:12:21.30,0:12:26.51,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(75,95)\an5\fnTimes New Roman\fs12\fscy140\c&H000000&\bord0\shad0\b1}Second-grade\NSorcerer\N{\fs24}Utahime\NIori
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.28,0:12:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be more polite!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.32,0:12:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I was crying, would you console me?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.51,0:12:29.26,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(558,120)\p1\bord0\shad0\an5\c&HF9F9F9&}m 0 0 l 140 0 l 140 200 l 0 200
Dialogue: 2,0:12:26.51,0:12:29.26,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(558,120)\an5\fnTimes New Roman\fs18\fscy140\c&H000000&\bord0\shad0\b1}First-grade\NSorcerer\N{\fs30}Mei Mei
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.06,0:12:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd definitely like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.52,0:12:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you wouldn't cry, Mae.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.36,0:12:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.44,0:12:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.76,0:12:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.67,0:12:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.12,0:12:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.26,0:12:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't swallow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.60,0:12:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll absorb it later.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.20,0:12:51.95,Main,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(548.5,157)\p1\bord0\shad0\an5\c&HF9F9F9&}m 0 0 l 136 0 l 136 200 l 0 200
Dialogue: 2,0:12:49.20,0:12:51.95,Main,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(548.5,157)\an5\fnTimes New Roman\fs14\fscy140\c&H000000&\bord0\shad0\b1}Jujutsu High\NSecond-Year\N{\fs30}Suguru\NGeto
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.52,0:12:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Satoru, it's not nice to\Npick on the weak, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.24,0:12:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, but what kind of idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.68,0:12:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Picks on the strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.18,0:12:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one naturally\Nfanning the flames, Code.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.60,0:13:02.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uchihime!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.38,0:13:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:05.34,0:13:10.72,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(480,187)\p1\bord0\shad0\an5\c&HF9F9F9&\bord0}m 0 0 l 136 0 l 136 200 l 0 200
Dialogue: 2,0:13:05.34,0:13:10.72,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(480,187)\an5\fnTimes New Roman\fs14\fscy140\c&H000000&\bord0\shad0\b1}Jujutsu High\NSecond-Year\N{\fs30}Shoko\NIeiri
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.60,0:13:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shouko!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.51,0:13:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.60,0:13:11.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We hadn't heard from\Nyou for two whole days.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.32,0:13:12.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shouko!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.44,0:13:14.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.35,0:13:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoko, don't let yourself\Nturn out like those two!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.16,0:13:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not trash like they\Nare, and I never will be.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.23,0:13:26.53,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\p1\c&HF8F9F6&\bord0\shad0\an5\pos(78,186)\clip(m 48 119 l 102 116 104 253 54 255)}m 0 0 l 50 0 l 50 140 l 0 140
Dialogue: 2,0:13:20.23,0:13:26.53,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\b1\fnArial\pos(78,184)\an5\fs20\c&H323331&\shad0\bord0}Said\NTrash
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.72,0:13:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let yourself turn out like Utahime.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.66,0:13:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.52,0:13:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.43,0:13:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, two days?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.68,0:13:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, was the cursed spirits barrier\None of those that messes with time?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.34,0:13:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're rare, but they\Ndo happen now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.60,0:13:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is odd it took so long\Nsince Mei was with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.80,0:13:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.80,0:13:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm? Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.84,0:13:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not really, but actually that means\Nit involved two full days of labor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.06,0:13:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I was just thinking\Nabout how to rewrite
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.10,0:13:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the invoice for extra fees now owed to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.70,0:13:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's planning to overcharge again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.84,0:13:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More importantly, what about...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.04,0:13:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the veil? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.58,0:14:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm? Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.06,0:14:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next up, yesterday's large explosion\Nrocked Shizoka prefecture...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:02.27,0:14:05.65,Sign_Basic,screen,0,0,0,,{\3c&HBBAD98&\shad0\c&HE1E0D0&\fs16\an7\fax-.3\bord1\fsp2\pos(414,75.333)}White\N\h\hNews
Dialogue: 1,0:14:02.27,0:14:05.65,Sign_Basic,screen,0,0,0,,{\3c&HB05D47&\shad0\c&HE1E0D0&\fs15\pos(453,250)\an3}Degradation of gas pipes causes explosion
Dialogue: 2,0:14:02.27,0:14:06.08,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Next, the explosion that occurred \Nyesterday in Hamamatsu, Shizuoka.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:06.08,0:14:08.58,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}The explosion was caused \Nby degradation of gas pipes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.20,0:14:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You three were supposed to\Noversee the mission at that home.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:08.58,0:14:10.15,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Our reporter on the scene...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.02,0:14:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.00,0:14:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you left your assistant\Nsupervisor behind and on
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.58,0:14:15.12,Main,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(531.5,166)\p1\bord0\shad0\an5\c&HF9F9F9&}m 0 0 l 126 0 l 126 184 l 0 184
Dialogue: 2,0:14:12.58,0:14:15.12,Main,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(531.5,166)\an5\fnTimes New Roman\fs18\fscy140\c&H000000&\bord0\shad0\b1}First-grade\NSorcerer\N{\fs29}Masamichi\NYaga
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.12,0:14:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,top of everything you forgot\Nthe veil who's to blame
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.10,0:14:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sensei, I'm asking you to stop\Nthis hunt for the culprits.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.90,0:14:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it was you then
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.04,0:14:23.80,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs40\bord0\shad0\c&H000000&}Discipline
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.42,0:14:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is a veil even really\Nnecessary in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.58,0:14:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not like it matters if\Nnormie see it or not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.44,0:14:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can't see curse spirits\Nor curse techniques anyway
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.98,0:14:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's not good if they do see them the\Nstrongest deterrent against the outbreak
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.32,0:14:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of a cursed spirit is the mental calm\Nof the populace that's exactly why we
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.68,0:14:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have to conceal all of these threats as\Nmuch as possible to make sure they never
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.46,0:14:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ever get to see them\Nand that's not looking
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.82,0:15:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.92,0:15:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.83,0:15:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the weak and
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.75,0:15:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,protecting them is
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.66,0:15:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,honestly so exhausting survival of the\Nweakest that's the proper shape of a proper
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.44,0:15:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,society the weak help each other and
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.94,0:15:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,discourage strength listen\NSatoru jujutsu exists
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.28,0:15:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to protect non jujutsu sorcerers moral
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.36,0:15:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,arguments I hate moral arguments what
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.72,0:15:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,assigning reasons and responsibility to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.18,0:15:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,strength is what those\Nwho are weak tend to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.18,0:15:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When are you going to quit making yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.76,0:15:46.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,feel better by spouting all this bullshit?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.34,0:15:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect time for a smoke break.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.44,0:15:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want to take this outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.66,0:15:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Satoru?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.58,0:15:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, you feeling lonely?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.62,0:15:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go by yourself if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.10,0:15:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.01,0:16:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long are you going\Nto keep fooling around?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.06,0:16:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did Shoko go? Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.62,0:16:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little girl's room?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.66,0:16:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.66,0:16:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This mission is being\Nassigned to you two anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.32,0:16:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are those faces for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.04,0:16:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.88,0:16:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Frankly, I think it's too much for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.54,0:16:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Tengen asked for you specifically.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.38,0:16:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your mission has two goals.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.36,0:16:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The star plasma vessel is the\None compatible with Tengen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.04,0:16:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are to escort that girl and erase her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.08,0:16:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Escort some brat and then erase her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.68,0:16:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.64,0:16:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's finally gone senile.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.52,0:16:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.80,0:16:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His head's probably full with\Nbeing the next principal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.60,0:16:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All jokes aside though that\Ndidn't sound like a joke to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:46.04,0:16:49.07,Main,Yaga,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'll be the one to decide \Nif I let that off as a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.82,0:16:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this about renewing Tingen's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.38,0:16:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,technique. Huh? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.30,0:16:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did I miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.08,0:17:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tengen possesses the curse technique of\Nimmortality, but it's not eternal youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.20,0:17:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a problem if all he did was get older,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.84,0:17:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but after his body ages\Nto a certain point,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.26,0:17:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the curse technique\Nbegins rewriting his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.84,0:17:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.75,0:17:17.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll cease to be human and\Nbecome a higher form of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.92,0:17:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's so bad about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.22,0:17:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.90,0:17:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to Tengen,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.38,0:17:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those who reach that state of\Nbeing no longer have any free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.52,0:17:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It means that Tengen would\Ncease to be Tengen any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.70,0:17:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the Jujutsu schools,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.77,0:17:31.52,Sign_Basic,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs16\fnTimes New Roman\c&H2A362B&\bord2\shad0\3c&H6C7A68&}Tokyo Jujutsu High School
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.66,0:17:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the barriers that form the\Nfoundation of Jujutsu society,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.16,0:17:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the many barrier techniques\Nof the assistant supervisors,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.28,0:17:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're all being strengthened by Tengen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.66,0:17:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And without the aid of his power,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.66,0:17:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we could hardly maintain security\Nor clean up after missions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.44,0:17:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the worst-case scenario, Tengen\Ncould even become a threat to mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.62,0:17:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why every 500 years he\Nfinds the Star Plasma Vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.34,0:17:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,someone who is compatible with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.24,0:18:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he assimilates them, overriding\Nthe information of their body.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.74,0:18:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By Tengen renewing his form,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.76,0:18:06.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he resets his curse technique to\Nthe start and avoids evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.94,0:18:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.30,0:18:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be fine if he\Ndigivolved into Metal Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.04,0:18:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we can't have him\Nturning into Skull Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.40,0:18:16.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we helped start him off\Nfrom the beginning at Coromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.48,0:18:18.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.39,0:18:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever works, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.92,0:18:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The location of the Star Plasma\NVessel has unfortunately been leaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.32,0:18:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.23,0:18:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there are two major groups who are\Nsimultaneously after the young girl's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.74,0:18:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One is the Curse User Group, Q.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.34,0:18:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They seek to upend Jujutsu\Nsociety with Tengen's rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.30,0:18:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other is the Star Religious Group,\Nalso known as the Time Vessel Association,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.52,0:18:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who worships Tengen as a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.14,0:18:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Tengen will assimilate the Star\NPlasma Vessel in just two days' time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.96,0:18:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are to protect this\Nyoung girl till then,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.12,0:18:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and ensure that Tengen reaches\Nher before the others do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.10,0:18:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you fail, the effects will ripple\Nthroughout even normal society.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.94,0:18:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So put your heart into this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.68,0:19:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.76,0:19:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get why Curse User Group\NQ would be after her,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.80,0:19:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but why would the Star Religious\NGroup want to kill some young kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.68,0:19:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their object of worship is\Nthe pure form of Tengen,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.28,0:19:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allowing the Star Plasma Vessel,\Nan impurity in their minds,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.76,0:19:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to blend into him is unforgivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.06,0:19:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Star Religious Group is\Nmade up of non-sorcerers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.08,0:19:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think we need\Nto pay them any mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.22,0:19:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ones to be wary of are definitely Q.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.20,0:19:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sure it'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.02,0:19:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are the strongest, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.10,0:19:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, that's why Tengen asked\Nfor us specifically, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.28,0:19:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, huh? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.60,0:19:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, Satoru, I've been\Nmeaning to say this for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.72,0:19:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you should really stop\Nbeing so full of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.62,0:19:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.06,0:19:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially when you're\Naddressing your superiors.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.70,0:19:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We might end up meeting Tengen soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.24,0:19:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really should be\Nmore polite and humble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.68,0:19:57.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would make you less threatening\Nto the juniors as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.06,0:19:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, screw that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.76,0:20:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Satoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.76,0:20:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.72,0:20:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can talk about it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.14,0:20:09.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.72,0:20:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.92,0:20:13.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.22,0:20:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.42,0:20:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.58,0:20:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think we'll be blamed\Nif the kid died from that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.68,0:20:26.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:25.93,0:20:26.32,Main,Gojo,0,0,0,,{\pos(135,231)\b1\bord3\shad0\c&H000000&\3c&HE5E7E7&}Ah
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.88,0:20:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't blame me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.30,0:20:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hate Tengen if you must hate anyone
Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.00,0:20:42.26,Main,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(526.5,144)\p1\bord0\shad0\an5\c&HFAFAFA&}m 0 0 l 112 0 l 112 164 l 0 164
Dialogue: 2,0:20:39.00,0:20:42.26,Main,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(1225,0)\pos(526.5,144)\an5\fnTimes New Roman\fs18\fscy140\c&H000000&\bord0\shad0\b1}Q\NCombatant\N{\fs30}Kokun
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.46,0:20:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.36,0:20:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you please stop\Nmaking us stand out so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.02,0:20:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just got called out for that this morning\NSo this girl is the Star Plasma Vessel?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.08,0:20:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those uniforms.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.12,0:20:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your sorceress from Jujutsu High.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.32,0:20:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hand over the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.76,0:20:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.16,0:21:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't quite hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.10,0:21:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come closer so we can talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.84,0:21:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.94,0:21:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.56,0:21:10.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.64,0:21:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Satoru Gojo, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.16,0:21:16.12,Main,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,400)\pos(113.5,146)\p1\bord0\shad0\an5\c&HFAFAFA&}m 0 0 l 136 0 l 136 164 l 0 164
Dialogue: 2,0:21:14.16,0:21:16.12,Main,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,400)\pos(113.5,146)\an5\fnTimes New Roman\fs18\fscy140\c&H000000&\bord0\shad0\b1}Q\NCombatant\N{\fs30}Bayer
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.32,0:21:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.44,0:21:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.90,0:21:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me find out if the rumors are true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.06,0:21:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, I'm game.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.38,0:21:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But let's set some rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.88,0:21:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.12,0:21:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, I don't want to get\Nyelled at for going overboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.02,0:21:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if you cry and apologize,\Nthen I won't kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.74,0:21:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's our rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.04,0:21:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You damn punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.06,0:21:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has started.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.40,0:21:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Star Religious Group doesn't have the\Npower to fight against Jujutsu Sorcerers,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.06,0:21:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they can pay very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.12,0:21:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I guarantee.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.00,0:21:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about it, Zenin?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.14,0:21:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want to get in on the assassination\Nof the Star Plasma Vessel?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.24,0:21:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a Zenin anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.36,0:21:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took my wife's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.26,0:22:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Fushiguro now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.06,0:22:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But sure, count me in on all the fun.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.97,0:22:09.97,Ep_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,Episode 25\N{\fs30\fscy150}Hidden Inventory
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.46,0:22:55.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear anything
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.26,0:22:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What place I'm doing is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.76,0:23:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I'm not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.88,0:23:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.98,0:23:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.70,0:23:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.22,0:23:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.38,0:23:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.29,0:23:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.98,0:23:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, the sky is dark.\NI'm afraid of the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.60,0:23:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid of the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.98,0:23:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not looking at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.02,0:23:18.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not looking at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.72,0:23:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know how some words\Nget stuck in your head,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.18,0:23:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah, like homeowners\Nassociation requirements.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.98,0:23:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, or like universal healthcare.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.40,0:23:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please watch the next\Nepisode, Hidden Inventory 2.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:47.50,0:23:49.94,Main,Shoko,0,0,0,,{\an8}Please look forward to the next \Nepisode, "Hidden Inventory 2"!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:47.50,0:23:54.99,Ep_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\bord2\blur4}Next Episode\N{\fs30\fscy150}Hidden Inventory 2
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.92,0:23:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's yours, Shoko?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:49.94,0:23:50.99,Main,Gojo,0,0,0,,{\an8}You tell us one, too, Shoko.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:50.99,0:23:52.70,Main,Shoko,0,0,0,,{\an8}Chagu Chagu Umakko.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.08,0:23:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fried chicken shop. Oh.

